{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/portainer/portainer","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:03:16.273Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/portainer/portainer/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/portainer/portainer"},"readme":"# This repository is deprecated. Starting from January 2022, the latest tag of this repository will point to Portainer CE 2.X. Please use portainer/portainer-ce instead.\n\n[![Docker Pulls](https://img.shields.io/docker/pulls/portainer/portainer.svg)](https://hub.docker.com/r/portainer/portainer/)\n\n\n**_NOTE, This repo, portainer/portainer is the home of Portainer v1.24.x, and is now deprecated; all new releases for Portainer 2.0 will be published in portainer/portainer-ce_**\n\n\n\n**_Portainer_** is a lightweight management UI which allows you to **easily** manage your Docker host or Swarm cluster.\n\n**_Portainer_** is meant to be as **simple** to deploy as it is to use. It consists of a single container that can run on any Docker engine (Docker for Linux and Docker for Windows are supported).\n\n**_Portainer_** allows you to manage your Docker stacks, containers, images, volumes, networks and more ! It is compatible with the *standalone Docker* engine and with *Docker Swarm*.\n\n## Getting started\n\n* [Deploy Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/installation/)\n* [Documentation](https://documentation.portainer.io/)\n\n## Getting help\n\n\nFor COMMUNITY support:\n* Issues: https://github.com/portainer/portainer/issues\n* FAQ: https://www.portainer.io/documentation/\n* Slack: http://portainer.io/slack/\n\n## Reporting bugs and contributing\n\n* Want to report a bug or request a feature? Please open [an issue](https://github.com/portainer/portainer/issues/new).\n* Want to help us build **_portainer_**? Follow our [contribution guidelines](https://documentation.portainer.io/contributing/instructions/) to build it  locally and make a pull request. We need all the help we can get!\n\n## Limitations\n\nPortainer supports the Current Docker version and two prior versions ONLY. Older versions may run, but are not supported in any way.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"portainer","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/portainer","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2016-09-15T21:09:26.858217Z","updated":"2022-11-21T02:21:15.56905Z","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":2978700782,"stars":2602},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":17333217521,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:47b064434edf437badf7337e516e07f64477485c8ecc663ddabbe824b20c672d","pushed":"2022-11-21T02:21:14.954055Z","size":86795383,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/s390x","linux/arm/v7","windows/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"linux-amd64-2.0.1","digest":null,"pushed":"2022-06-28T21:38:54.165226Z","size":56657214,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"linux-ppc64le-2.0.1","digest":null,"pushed":"2022-06-28T21:36:19.204344Z","size":25476818,"platforms":["linux/ppc64le"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"linux-s390x-2.0.1","digest":null,"pushed":"2022-06-28T21:36:08.331089Z","size":27670184,"platforms":["linux/s390x"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"linux-arm64-2.0.1","digest":null,"pushed":"2022-06-28T21:35:57.73368Z","size":37307071,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"linux-arm-2.0.1","digest":null,"pushed":"2022-06-28T21:35:46.672818Z","size":52012017,"platforms":["linux/arm"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json